항 확인표시된 두 포인트 사이의 저항을 측정한다두 접점 사이의 저항 값이 약 20Ω~25 Ω 정도라면 히터가 정상이다. 저항이 1kΩ 이상일 경우 히터가 손상된 것 \n▶상세 정보· 히터의 문제일 경우, 신규 히터 필요\n \n#히터#오류#작동","author":"송민규","date":"20260911100048","editedDateTime":"20261021105855","status":"대기","url":"https://flow.team/l/QsHNi"},"assets":{"https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609112550312_870fc6f5-5860-46f6-8a4b-91b2b60d90da.png":"images/58005cee59b10076e2800da7c52e671ff638e3ec8ee8e889a41dd2a2afd8f75e.png","https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609112557233_30ea170b-6f46-463f-9a66-e137c66487e6.png":"images/c45450d2a3d2850e5edfc68f965c9ef850983e9c71cefb5a8f12b3f79a8d8081.png","https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609112508147_67af10e1-501f-48d1-8b40-8b4165ca396a.png":"images/ec6e7ed4a3fc6eb5091c633dd71b90dc840170d5c6da067226fffd08050df879.png","https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609112570359_14b45def-6550-4573-a295-262d7d044c59.png":"images/88cc35aa3def359f639b4f8e50e6cc2eaa386184e04fa5602f5250cabaee2945.png","https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609112694447_f7787c39-e310-4bf7-babc-38088679e097.png":"images/2bf84678707dc7087a2e5775f7a07e3b8f6e114cc530c5db218199ee36172b98.png","https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_20260911277878_3c651f99-4c87-44a7-a3f7-d8764f4df97c.png":"images/99eed9c72352474ad115e42fd25e65b47442896166781c3ee41e21dc60806211.png","https://flow.team/flowImg/FLOW_202609112744240_c27eae75-03cc-4f5f-9566-a1bf18d5f1e3.png":"images/e21875faec80685f81e1e5fd569f699f864f11df48c3687ba41051bca80cf093.png"}}